  "title": "Syracuse Parcel Map (2019 October)",
  "description": "Data Dictionary: Label Definition Sec_Block Section & Block numbers TAX_ID, TAX_ID_1 City Tax ID number (26 digit number used for parcel mapping) PRINTKEY Stands for Section, Block, Lot. This is a property tax number unique to this property PNUMBR Property Number FullAddress Full Address of the property. StNum Street Number StName Street Name BlockLevel 100 Block that the street is on. Owner Property Owner Owner2 If there is a second owner of the property, they will be listed here. Add1, Add2, Add3, Add4 Owner Address TaxBillingAddress The owners address listed under tax billing. ZIP, ZIP2 Owner Zip YearBuilt Year structure was build. LandUse What the land is designated to be used as (for example: Single family, two family, utility, vacant, etc). LUCODE Land use code. This references what is found in the LandUse column. Units Only for multi-unit residential buildings TNT TNT area name. Census Census tract the parcel is within. Neighborhood Planning Neighborhoods NRSA Neighborhood Revitalization Strategy Area. Designated areas in the city that is used to target state and investment funds. CommonCouncil Common Council District. Zoning Classification for this parcel and how it is zoned. This designates what you can build and where. More information can be found at: https://www.syr.gov/Departments/Zoning/Zoning-Rules-and-Regulations Ward City Ward that this parcel is within. DOCE_Area Division of Codes Enforcement area. This refers to the designated CODES Inspector for that geographic area. CountyLeg County Legislative district. n_OpenViols Number of open Codes Violations. This is a summary by parcel and only reflects the Codes violations when this data was pulled. This should include all units within this building. OpenCodeVi Code Violations that are open. VacantBuilding Y = Determined vacant by the Division of Code Enforcement IPSVacant Refers to what is flagged in IPS (City of Syracuse database) parcel attribute. WaterService I = inactive water AssessedValue Assessed value of the property. AssessedLandValue Assessed value of the land. Seizable Y = seizable for tax delinquency Bankruptcy Bankruptcy or Foreclosure 'flagged' Amount_Del Total Taxes Owed by the owner. STARS Senior Tax Exemption. Y = property is taking advantage of the owner occupant exemption. STARC Star Tax Exemption. STAR Star Tax Exemption. Y = property is taking advantage of the owner occupant exemption. OverdueWat If there is a balance owed to the Syracuse Water Department. TaxTrust Active Tax Trust SENIOR_EXEMPT Senior Tax Exemption VET_EXEMPT Veteran Tax Exemption FRONTFEET How wide the parcel is (in feet). DEPTH How deep the property is (in feet). ACRES Number of acres the parcel is. AssessmentDistrict Assessment District Longitude Longitude of this parcel. Latitude Latitude of this parcel. ObjectID Unique identifier, assigned by ArcGIS to the dataset. Dataset Contact Information: Organization: City of Syracuse Position: Data Program Manager Email: opendata@syr.gov City: Syracuse, NY",
